@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@orderId = replace-with-order-id

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Safe default: dry run
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: dry-run-demo-001

{}

### List orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### Order status
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### Real order: requires explicit confirmation. Do not send until HR asks to test.
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: replace-with-a-new-unique-key

{
  "dryRun": false,
  "confirm": "PAY 146"
}

### Send HR OTP only when order status is AWAITING_OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "otp": "123456"
}

### Resolve uncertain post-OTP order after checking Order Center
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resolution": "not_charged"
}

### Latest parsed balance and reconciliation status
GET {{baseUrl}}/balance
